    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET. \r\n\r\nLocated in the popular Brindley Park Estate on the north side of Ashbourne Town, within 2 minutes’ walk of the primary & secondary school campus, Gaa grounds and Ashbourne Town.\r\n\r\nNo 73 is a 2 bedroom mid terraced family home in excellent condition, with parking at the front door and a west facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nAccommodation of c.72 sq.m includes ; entrance hall, front living-room, a separate dining-room / kitchen with double doors to the rear garden. Upstairs comprises 2 double bedrooms, ensuite and a family bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation 70 sq.m \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall : 1.72 x 1.71 \tlaminate timber floor, radiator cover, door to :\r\nLounge :   4.17 x 3.54\t \ttimber flooring, cast iron fireplace, double doors to :\r\nKitchen / Diner :   4.44 x 3.97 : \tporcelain tiled floor, modern floor & eye level units, tiled splash-back, exit door to rear garden.\r\nUtility : \r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding : \t1.90 x 1.09\tcarpeted, access to attic.\r\nBathroom : \t2.27 x 1.88 \tfully tiled with wc, whb and double shower with glass door., window to side.\r\nBedroom 1 : \t3.65 x 3.54 \tDouble with built in wardrobes, laminate timber floor.. \r\nEnsuite : \t2.01 x 1.36\ttiled floor, shower, wc, whb.\r\nBedroom 2 : \t3.63 x 2.44 \tDouble with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nTo front : small paved area and parking at the front door. \r\nTo rear : Concrete panel and post fenced rear garden with a large decking area and brick built pizza oven and BBQ area., wooden shed. Sunny west facing aspect"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "# Modern Family home in excellent condition\r\n# West facing rear garden \r\n# Parking at the front door.\r\n# Natural gas heating. Alarm.\r\n# Potential to convert the attic to another bedroom.\r\n# Within minutes’ walk to Town centre, Gaa grounds and the new schools campus."
      },
